# round B36 (w188): the lever on the affine itself: round 151's cell (the HiGHS vector with GO appended in the affine) with the affine in its own optimizer group at weight decay 0.1 and the full rate (--ess-affine-weight-decay 0.1; round 119 read decay and a tenth of the rate together on the degenerate store and lost the gain, so the rate is left alone). Rounds 158 to 164 read the annotation arms as the affine alone, so regularizing the affine is the one setting left that acts on the read. Paired against w168_bxdelgopfba (no decay) and w189_bxdelgopfbawd1 (decay 1.0).
